{"bookInfo":{"bookId":"42000010299","bookName":"Las cicatrices que grabaste en mí (Doblado)","cover":"https://thwztchapter.dramaboxdb.com/data/cppartner/4x2/42x0/420x0/42000010299/42000010299.jpg@w=360&h=640","viewCount":17969408,"followCount":421234,"introduction":"Perla Ximénez e Ian Jara vivieron un amor intenso sin que ella supiera que él era un poderoso heredero. Al descubrir su enfermedad terminal y su embarazo, Perla finge ser una mujer interesada y lo abandona para salvarlo, dando a luz en secreto a su hijo, Andrés. Cinco años después, el niño salva a la madre de Ian, pero la maldad de su prometida provoca su muerte. Manipulado, Ian cree que Perla es ambiciosa y el rencor entre ambos se vuelve irreparable.","chapterCount":71,"labels":["Single Mom","Billionaire"],"tags":["Single Mom","Billionaire"],"typeTwoIds":[297],"typeTwoNames":["Amor Amargo"],"typeTwoList":[{"id":297,"name":"Amor Amargo","replaceName":"amor-amargo"}],"language":"SPANISH","typeTwoName":"Amor-Amargo","simpleLanguage":"es","bookNameEn":"Las-cicatrices-que-grabaste-en-mí-Doblado","bookNameLower":"las-cicatrices-que-grabaste-en-mí-doblado","shelfTime":"2026-04-28 12:00:00","firstShelfTime":"2026-04-28 12:00:00","performerList":[{"performerId":"15344","performerName":"He Qing","performerFormatName":"He-Qing","performerAvatar":"https://hwztchapter.dramaboxdb.com/data/cppartner/4x4/15344/15344.jpg?time=1786699957473","videoCount":2},{"performerId":"22569","performerName":"Xinghe Zhang","performerFormatName":"Xinghe-Zhang","performerAvatar":"https://hwztchapter.dramaboxdb.com/data/cppartner/9x6/22569/22569.jpg?time=1786699957270","videoCount":2}],"performerIdList":[15344,22569]},"chapterList":[{"id":"700670580","index":0,"unlock":true,"mp4":"https://hwvideoseo.dramaboxdb.com/08/9x9/99x2/992x0/99201000024/700670580_1/700670580.720p.narrowv3.mp4?Expires=1795197600&Signature=VDLSGlMMxwNLJKPybbz5~kbql105Fjrm3LTbieG3uP8HnbQVMb4KXuw13LyfkfNXk8IU1q~khpdEjx5qsw82QKXWHj3-4Sn6j9GHyjnDxifC3406tq9R1k93UgzuAm